        "sentence": "Zero-dependency async TCP, WebSocket WSS, and Protobuf library for ESP32 and ESP8266. One call in setup(), nothing in loop().",
        "paragraph": "Built-in lightweight TCP & WebSocket WSS connection engine and inline Protobuf serializer (no external libraries required). Uses WiFiClient/WiFiClientSecure from the ESP32/ESP8266 SDK. Single-owner socket engine driven from a dedicated FreeRTOS task (ESP32) or scheduled function (ESP8266) with a thread-safe outbox — no socket access from timer/ISR or WiFi-event contexts, eliminating race conditions. Automatic online/offline status, heartbeat, WiFi, TCP, and WebSocket auto-reconnect. Supports per-parameter command callbacks, TLS/SSL, WSS port 443, and automatic device ID generation via MAC address.",
